reserved, EWS, OBC, SC, ST and other applicable sub-categories. The individual scorecard displays the candidate''''s name, roll number, category, sectional and total marks, normalised marks where applicable, and the final qualifying status. Candidates are advised to download and preserve their scorecard, as it serves as an important record and may be required at later stages of the recruitment.</p><h3>Next Steps for Qualified Candidates</h3><p>Candidates who have qualified must prepare for the subsequent stages of the selection process. The overall recruitment consists of a single Computer Based Test, a Physical Efficiency Test, document verification and a medical examination.  Qualified candidates should keep their educational certificates, category certificate, identity proof and recent photographs ready for document verification, and should regularly check the official website for the schedule of the next stage. The final merit and appointment are subject to successful completion of all remaining stages.</p><h3>Eligibility Recap</h3><p>This recruitment is open to candidates fulfilling the qualification of a 10th class pass, or a National Apprenticeship Certificate, or an ITI certificate from a recognized institution. Candidates who qualify the Computer Based Test are shortlisted for the Physical Efficiency Test in the prescribed ratio. The prescribed age limit is 18 to 36 years as on the cut-off date. Candidates should note that meeting the eligibility conditions is mandatory and will be strictly verified before final selection.</p><h3>Important Note</h3><p>Candidates should rely solely on the official website https://rrbcdg.gov.in for authentic result-related information and must beware of fraudulent agents or unofficial websites that claim to influence results. Any grievance regarding the result should be addressed to the Railway Recruitment Boards through the prescribed official channel within the timeframe specified in the result notice, after which representations are generally not entertained.</p>', 'Railways', 'RRB', 'Railway Recruitment Boards', 'result', '2026-06-08', '2026-12-15', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20', NULL, '2026-12-15', '2026-06-19 10:00:00', 32438, '18 to 36 years as on the cut-off date', 'a 10th class pass, or a National Apprenticeship Certificate, or an ITI certificate from a recognized institution', 'Candidates who qualify the Computer Based Test are shortlisted for the Physical Efficiency Test in the prescribed ratio.', 500.00, 500.00, 250.00, 'https://rrbcdg.gov.in', 'https://rrbcdg.gov.in', 'https://rrbcdg.gov.in/group-d-2026-result.pdf', 'https://rrbcdg.gov.in/result', NULL, NULL, 'result', 'RESULT', 0, 1, 'RRB Group D 2026 CBT Result – Scorecard & Cut Off at rrbcdg.gov.in', 'RRB Group D 2026 CBT result declared. Check normalised marks and category-wise cut off at rrbcdg.gov.in. PET shortlist released.', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
